<section class="hero compact">
    <p class="eyebrow">MKINITRAMFS / CONFIGURATION</p>
    <h1>mkinitramfs.conf</h1>

    <p class="lead">
        Complete reference for the shell configuration loaded by
        <code>mkinitramfs</code>, including every documented variable, hook
        precedence, search paths, and command-line overrides.
    </p>
</section>

